{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>Give</b> — The husband says to his sons: Give her from the fruit of her hands, until those who praise praise her for her deeds, or her deeds themselves will praise her. And the giving is in speech, as in: Give to YHWH your Elohim honor. The book of Proverbs is completed."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:25:53.801253037Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}